----------------- KNOWN BUGS / INVESTIGATION
- ipairs vs # on _layers: RESOLVED. _layers is built fresh in ANN:new() with
  sequential integer keys (o._layers[1], o._layers[2], ...) and never modified
  after construction. No hash-part contamination possible. The # operator is safe.
  The original concern was from a different table; the layer-sort fix in
  ann_neat.lua addressed ordering, not this.

